TASK A — schema: UserEvent, GuestSession, ScraperLog, ApiKey, Waitlist models
and the User attribution/onboarding columns; append-only policy enforced on
DistrictMetrics, MarketSummary, NationalityFlow and derivatives.

TASK B — guest mode: sqftlab_guest cookie + GuestSession tracking, getCallerTier
limits (6 communities, 3-month trend, 10 listings, no deal badge), 401 upgrade
responses on cma/portfolio/api-keys/alerts, fire-and-forget UserEvent tracking.

TASK C — sign-in: magic-link + Google sign-in page with 3-step onboarding,
single-use tokens, guest-to-user attribution, deep-linkable /auth/signin.

TASK D — trend: real transaction aggregation replacing Math.random().

TASK E — auth: getUserId() now reads the cookie establishSession() actually
issues (next-auth.session-token). Reading 'session' meant no session cookie ever
authenticated — /auth/session, onboarding and /api-keys all returned 401.

TASK F — isDeal: flag at 8% below the area's 90-day DLD median, computed from
one grouped query. Was 12% off the listing median; rent rows kept stale flags.

Also: /scrape and /detect-deals now use the CRON_SECRET helper instead of a
hardcoded literal; nested asset paths fold back to the root so deep links render.

Co-authored-by: Shogo Agent <agent@shogo.ai>
